== units
rationale: Allocation v2 by group (PE 34, Secondaries 14, Co-investment 18, Capital Solutions 8, Private Credit 14 (SMA 40%, closed-end 45%, evergreen 10%, BDC 5%), hedge funds 20, long-only 36 (DM 22, EM 6, FI 8), Real Assets 18 (RE 9.0, infra 6.5, ENR 2.5)); PE unfunded $10.9bn (census v1.1 rescaled to the v2 bucket); Secondaries $3.5bn; Real Assets $3.5bn. 55 holdings plus three overlay positions and Treasury.
